\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces \centering  Evolution of sampled architectures' parameter counts during genetic search with a parameter-based discriminator. The paired ZCP guiding the search is \texttt  {meco}, which is usually biased towards overparameterized models. The average parameter count and its std error (in green) are constrained by the linear $\tau $ schedule during the search.}}{9}{figure.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig_params_meco}{{6}{9}{\centering Evolution of sampled architectures' parameter counts during genetic search with a parameter-based discriminator. The paired ZCP guiding the search is \texttt {meco}, which is usually biased towards overparameterized models. The average parameter count and its std error (in green) are constrained by the linear $\tau $ schedule during the search}{figure.caption.10}{}}
